  message:
  - It is finally time.
  - After 5 years i must let you go.
  - 'Even though i knew this day would come '
  - I am proud of what you have become
  - But you will never be able to do this alone.
  - a city North West of here you will find the Resistance, i hope they can help
    you.
  - Now go, i hope i will see you again one day
